BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Stephen Sosnick Memorial Chess Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260410T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260412T200000
UID:3784f8a031e5d0087fb40a6b1dc6a4d78192025_9:17:24_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:The Chess Club at UC Davis and Sosnick Chess\, a non-profit ho
 noring the late UCD Professor Stephen Sosnick\, join forces to sponsor a w
 eekend chess festival on April 10-12\, 2026 at the UCD Conference Center. 
 Grand Master Joel Benjaman will play a 25-person simultaneous exhibition g
 ame\, lecture and provide game commentary to festival attendees. There is 
 no charge to attend the festival. On each of Saturday and Sunday there wil
 l also be a US Chess Federation sanctioned tournament where Unrated player
 s to International Masters test their skills in one of the several levels 
 of tournament play. All ages are welcome. Sign up to play in the tournamen
 t is through https://www.kingregistration.com/tournaments#davis.
LOCATION:UC Davis Confrence Center\, 1 Shields Ave\, Davis\, California 95
 616\, United States
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=905706
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Quince
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260410T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260410T220000
UID:7f4d3d795be3aeb6865b814db88a122d1272026_4:41:52_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Queer Quince is a celebration of Queer and tTrans Latine ident
 ities. Quinceaneras are typically a celebration of a young lady entering w
 omanhood\, today\, we put our own twist and turn it into a celebration of 
 queer and trans love and self acceptance! The event features a DJ\, Drag P
 erformers\, a Baile Sorpresa from Danzantes del Alma\, Snacks and Beverage
 s\, and a Dance Floor. We want to celebrate the intersectionality of multi
 ple identities\, honor cultural traditions\, and offer everyone a safe spa
 ce for community\, belonging\, and fun. So please\, be you and bring yours
 elf\, we would love to have you!
LOCATION:ARC Ballroom AandB\, Lesbian Gay Bisexual Transgender Queer Inter
 sex Asexual Resource Center\, 397 Hutchison Dr\, Davis\, CA 95616\, Davis\
 , CA 95616\, United States
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908245
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
