DESCRIPTION:Hello Midnight Grinders!\n\nBring your BIGGEST hot takes and f
 unniest confessions to our Night Cafe Event on 5/8 Friday 6:30-10PM at Cal
 ifornia Hall. The kitchen will open at 7PM!\n\nFor this week's event\, we 
 want to hear your opinions and thoughts across different categories! Every
 one will get the chance to vote for the top three takes of the night. Don'
 t be afraid to share your boldest opinions\, we want to hear it! Please br
 ing a pencil or a pen to participate in this activity. \n\nWhether if you'
 re catching up with some friends or looking for a cozy place to study - co
 me stop by the Night Cafe in Davis! We're here to provide students a sense
  of community and comfort during those late night hours when campus can fe
 el empty and quiet. We are super excited to feature some NEW menu items fo
 r this week\, we hope to see you there.\n\nDue to our night cafe being a p
 rivate event\, you must be on the RSVP guest list or part of our membershi
 p program to be allowed entry. Please RSVP for our Event by 5/8 Friday at 
 5PM!
