BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Animal Allies Therapy Fluffies
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260527T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260527T130000
UID:f4a022f07027af97f2ffc61f105bd86d552026_3:54:27_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Our club will bring out 1-3 adoptable dogs from a local animal
  shelter. Each dog will be in individual pens with multiple handlers each.
  We will have 1-2 pop-up shade structures depending on weather/temperature
 . The dogs will be available for UC Davis students and staff/faculty to co
 me interact with\, pet\, and de-stress. This will help spread awareness of
